    {
      "id": "s02",
      "type": "single_fact",
      "question": "感知机的损失函数是怎么定义的",
      "refused": false,
      "sentinel_refused": false,
      "partial_gap": false,
      "expect_refusal": false,
      "refusal_correct": true,
      "citation_count": 3,
      "citation_valid": 3,
      "citation_invalid": 0,
      "cited_sources": [
        "pumpkin-book.pdf"
      ],
      "faithfulness": 1.0,
      "faith_claims": 5,
      "faith_parse_failed": false,
      "answer_chars": 248,
      "context_chars": 2009,
      "context_blocks": 4,
      "answer": "感知机的损失函数定义为 L(w, θ) = Σ_{xi∈M} (ŷi − yi)(wTxi − θ)，其中 M ⊆ T 为误分类样本集合。[来源: pumpkin-book.pdf 第55页]\n\n该损失函数是非负的；如果没有误分类点，则损失函数值为 0；误分类点越少、误分类点离超平面越近，损失函数值就越小。[来源: pumpkin-book.pdf 第55页]\n\n给定数据集 T，损失函数 L(w, θ) 是关于 w, θ 的连续可导函数。[来源: pumpkin-book.pdf 第55页]"
    },
    {
